  },
  {
   "line": 687,
   "text": "Speed through the zombie apocalypse and escape the quarantined city!\\n\\nNormal difficulty"
  },
  {
   "line": 693,
   "text": "This is the road for survivors with something to prove!\\n\\nHard difficulty"
  },
  {
   "line": 697,
   "text": "This is for survivors with something to prove!\\n\\nHard difficulty\\nComplete The Great Escape to unlock this mode!"
  },
  {
   "line": 702,
   "text": "You\\'re living on borrowed time.\\n\\nGet as far as you can by killing zombies to earn extra time!"
  },
  {
   "line": 706,
   "text": "This is war and you are a one man army on wheels!\\n\\nGet as far as you can while facing brutal military resistance!"
  },
  {
   "line": 710,
   "text": "Play more games at newgrounds.com, where artists, programmers, musicians, writers and voice actors join forces to make pure awesomeness!"
  },
  {
   "line": 714,
   "text": "Evil-Dog.com\\n\\nCheck out my other games, my music and my movies on my official website!"
  },
  {
   "line": 718,
   "text": "SickDeathFiend.com\\n\\nCheck out more movies and art by SickDeathFiend on his official website!"
  },
  {
   "line": 722,
   "text": "Music made by\\nSymphony of Specters\\n\\nVisit their website for more amazing music!"
  },
  {
   "line": 726,
   "text": "Surviving the zombie apocalypse requires a complete set of skills.\\nDo You have what it takes to complete all the achievements?"
  },
  {
   "line": 730,
   "text": "In options, you can:\\nCustomize your controls\\nToggle sound and music\\nSet graphic quality\\nEnable/Disable buildings\\nDelete your save data"
  },
  {
   "line": 734,
   "text": "Are you trying to be the greatest survivor?\\n\\nCheck the high scores for the Dead On Time and Police State modes!"
  },
